  "description": "Heo Ji-hyuk is an attention seeker and a texting addict. Always number one in terms of looks and popularity, Ji-hyuk’s world was turned upside down when Soo-ho came into the picture. When Soo-ho threatens his top-of-the-league number of social media followers, Ji-hyuk begins to feel insecure and discovers the ‘Kiss Your Boyfriend Challenge’.\n\n“If I do this with Soo-ho, can I get 100 million views? He made me live with an inferiority complex for years, so he deserves to be taken advantage of!”\n\n---\n\n**Original Webtoon:**  \n[Bomtoon](https://www.bomtoon.com/detail/KissChallenge)\n\n**Official Translations:**  \n[Thai](https://www.lezhinth.com/detail/KissChallenge)\n\n##### Note: The official Thai translation is uncensored.",
